              "name": "LadyVictorie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Something happened to my \"original\" recipe once I submitted it to be published. Did \"the kitchen\" tester change it? First, I roll the chicken rolls in breadcrumbs, NOT sprinkle them atop. Secondly, I bake mine at 350 NOT 375. You can even try baking it at 325 for one hour. This looks like my recipe and it has my name on it, but it is not the same."
